Just after I hit the send button, I remembered how to do it.  (Isn't it always
the case!)  I have put the instructions on a sticker attached to the machine,
so I won't forget next time.

You need to type:

set os_type NT

at the >>> prompt.  Then power cycle your machine and you should
be in the ARC firmware.  There is a menu item under "supplementary menu"
down a few levels which allows you to set the console back to Digital UNIX
(SRM).

