Well, it seems I like to make things harder than they should be!
All that was required was to create the appropriate device
files, like so:

	cd /dev
	./MAKEDEV tzxx

where 'xx' is the appropriate SCSI ID.  I admit, I should have tried
this first.  Twenty lashes with a SCSI cable!

One person sent me a working Ultrix entry, which I did not try
out.  

