After upgrading to DU 4.0 i noticed that the vi command didn't work 
anymore. The command "vi filename" just returned me to the unix prompt. 
I noticed that "vi -s filename" still worked. After about one
hour of puzzling and trying several things i thought of the .exrc file in 
