i missed the original post, but if your intent is to change the
printer where the bootstrap save set ids are printed every night, you
can just change the PRINTER variable in /usr/bin/saveindex, which is
just a link to /usr/opt/BRX320/BRXSOAKIT320/bin/decaxp.saveindex.
look for a line ilke 
 
